(Combining I2C, SPI, OneWire, and WiFi functionality in a single loop required careful attention to blocking) Tj
T* (code. If the code spent too much time waiting for an RFID tag, reading the OneWire sensor, or drawing to the) Tj
T* (OLED, the web server would become unresponsive to incoming HTTP requests. Keeping the loop fast and) Tj
T* (non-blocking was key to a successful IoT device.) Tj
ET
